 "title": "The derived tensor product of sheaves is a two-variable left derived functor",
 "statement": "The derived tensor product $-\\otimes^{\\mathrm L}-$ of [def-sfb-derived-tensor-sheaves],\ntogether with the lax monoidal structure map of the localization functor, is the left\nderived functor in two variables of the tensor product of complexes of pro-étale sheaves,\nwith respect to the quasi-isomorphisms in each variable.",
